    {
      "id": "claim_791cd52f331441088a42eda5f3cf77a6",
      "statement": "The unsupported-format exit is the run loop's only consumer of the triage category — the other consumer being `cqg parse`, which records that category in the entry's provenance so the exit is reachable identically on the parsed path — and it is currently unreachable through a normal corpus walk since every extension in SUPPORTED_EXTS has a parser; it is retained as the landing for a format admitted ahead of its parser and covered by a test that drives it through triage directly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cqg/cli.py#L105-L118",
