    {
      "id": "claim_5f381c75fc8942b9b002755fa2567c82",
      "statement": "The run orchestration auto-detects its entry mode with `is_parsed_input` before the loop: a raw folder is triaged and parsed on the fly with strictly unchanged behaviour, a parsed_input/ is read back entry by entry without ever opening a source file, and a folder holding both raises instead of being guessed at. The two modes converge on the same item shape, so everything downstream of acquisition is the same code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cqg/cli.py#L218-L220",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:21e9b9b6b7d210122bdbc43962d14c9b592389a8fc6c9aedb01c7b1bc658f313:"
        },
