    {
      "id": "claim_01a384a213a644f8b06c0c5306db7874",
      "statement": "The split changes no score, and this is pinned rather than asserted: a regression test compares `parse` followed by `run <parsed_input>` against a direct `run <raw>` and requires every *.score.json to be strictly identical, over four documents and in both the non-enriched and enriched cases, with the enriched split run deliberately scoring with enrichment off so the equality rests on the markdown `parse` wrote.",
